# Each medication record in an entry is given the exposure its own current version shows, as the eCQM library
# CumulativeMedicationDuration 4.1.000 gives a medication's period: from its start of use, else its one dosage's
# bounds' start, else the day its prescription was written, else the start of its dispensing window; to its end of use,
# else its start plus its supply times one plus its repeats, less a day, in whole days, else its one dosage's bounds' end
# (the library reads what the copy states, and a rule filters intent and status, as the library's callers do). A
# version with several dosages has no one dosage, as the library's `singleton from` has none. A start given only to the
# year or month is read as its last day and an end as its first, a time as its day, and a supply counted from the
# start's first day, so exposure is never overstated; a supply that is a bound, or not in a UCUM unit of time, is not
# read. With no end, the exposure is ongoing when the record's own lifecycle is active, and is neither ended nor ongoing
# otherwise. A record with no start, or whose end so read falls before its start, has no exposure, as the library gives
# no period. Copies are never collapsed here: an entry's exposure is a rule's, over every member.
PREFIX cascade: <https://ns.cascadeprotocol.org/cascade#>
PREFIX pav: <http://purl.org/pav/>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

CONSTRUCT {
  ?record cascade:medicationExposureStart ?start ; cascade:medicationExposureEnd ?end ;
          cascade:medicationExposureOngoing ?ongoing .
}
WHERE {
  ?record a cascade:PrescribedOrReportedMedication ; cascade:inEntry [] ; pav:hasCurrentVersion ?version .
  OPTIONAL { ?version cascade:medicationUseStartDate ?useStart }
  OPTIONAL { ?version cascade:structuredDosage ?startDosage . ?startDosage cascade:dosageBoundsPeriodStart ?boundsStart
             FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?version cascade:structuredDosage ?otherStartDosage FILTER (!sameTerm(?otherStartDosage, ?startDosage)) } }
  OPTIONAL { ?version cascade:prescriptionWrittenDate ?written }
  OPTIONAL { ?version cascade:dispenseValidityPeriodStart ?validFrom }
  OPTIONAL { ?version cascade:medicationUseEndDate ?useEnd }
  OPTIONAL { ?version cascade:structuredDosage ?endDosage . ?endDosage cascade:dosageBoundsPeriodEnd ?boundsEnd
             FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?version cascade:structuredDosage ?otherEndDosage FILTER (!sameTerm(?otherEndDosage, ?endDosage)) } }
  OPTIONAL { ?version cascade:expectedSupplyDuration ?supply . ?supply cascade:decimalValue ?supplyValue ; cascade:ucumUnit ?supplyUnit
             FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?supply cascade:quantityComparator ?supplyComparator } }
  OPTIONAL { ?version cascade:numberOfRepeatsAllowed ?repeats }
  OPTIONAL { ?record cascade:currentVersionStatusLifecycle ?lifecycle }
  BIND (COALESCE(?useStart, ?boundsStart, ?written, ?validFrom) AS ?from)
  BIND (xsd:integer(SUBSTR(STR(?from), 1, 4)) AS ?year)
  BIND (SUBSTR(STR(?from), 6, 2) AS ?month)
  BIND (?year - 4 * FLOOR(?year / 4) = 0 && (?year - 100 * FLOOR(?year / 100) != 0 || ?year - 400 * FLOOR(?year / 400) = 0)
        AS ?leap)
  BIND (IF(BOUND(?from),
           STRDT(IF(sameTerm(DATATYPE(?from), xsd:gYear), CONCAT(SUBSTR(STR(?from), 1, 4), "-12-31"),
                 IF(sameTerm(DATATYPE(?from), xsd:gYearMonth),
                    CONCAT(SUBSTR(STR(?from), 1, 7), "-",
                           IF(?month IN ("04", "06", "09", "11"), "30", IF(?month = "02", IF(?leap, "29", "28"), "31"))),
                    SUBSTR(STR(?from), 1, 10))), xsd:date),
           1/0) AS ?start)
  BIND (IF(BOUND(?from),
           STRDT(IF(sameTerm(DATATYPE(?from), xsd:gYear), CONCAT(SUBSTR(STR(?from), 1, 4), "-01-01"),
                 IF(sameTerm(DATATYPE(?from), xsd:gYearMonth), CONCAT(SUBSTR(STR(?from), 1, 7), "-01"),
                    SUBSTR(STR(?from), 1, 10))), xsd:date),
           1/0) AS ?firstDayFrom)
  BIND (IF(BOUND(?supplyValue),
           IF(?supplyUnit = "d", ?supplyValue, IF(?supplyUnit = "wk", ?supplyValue * 7,
           IF(?supplyUnit = "mo", ?supplyValue * 30.4375, IF(?supplyUnit = "a", ?supplyValue * 365.25,
           IF(?supplyUnit = "h", ?supplyValue / 24, IF(?supplyUnit = "min", ?supplyValue / 1440,
           IF(?supplyUnit = "s", ?supplyValue / 86400, 1/0))))))),
           1/0) AS ?supplyDays)
  BIND (IF(BOUND(?supplyDays),
           xsd:integer(FLOOR(?supplyDays * (1 + IF(BOUND(?repeats), xsd:integer(STR(?repeats)), 0)))),
           1/0) AS ?suppliedDays)
  BIND (IF(BOUND(?suppliedDays) && ?suppliedDays >= 1, STRDT(CONCAT("P", STR(?suppliedDays - 1), "D"), xsd:dayTimeDuration), 1/0)
        AS ?suppliedDaysAfterTheFirst)
  BIND (IF(BOUND(?firstDayFrom) && BOUND(?suppliedDaysAfterTheFirst), ?firstDayFrom + ?suppliedDaysAfterTheFirst, 1/0) AS ?supplyEnd)
  BIND (IF(BOUND(?useEnd), ?useEnd, IF(BOUND(?supplyEnd) || !BOUND(?boundsEnd), 1/0, ?boundsEnd)) AS ?statedEnd)
  BIND (IF(BOUND(?statedEnd),
           STRDT(IF(sameTerm(DATATYPE(?statedEnd), xsd:gYear), CONCAT(SUBSTR(STR(?statedEnd), 1, 4), "-01-01"),
                 IF(sameTerm(DATATYPE(?statedEnd), xsd:gYearMonth), CONCAT(SUBSTR(STR(?statedEnd), 1, 7), "-01"),
                    SUBSTR(STR(?statedEnd), 1, 10))), xsd:date),
           IF(BOUND(?supplyEnd), ?supplyEnd, 1/0)) AS ?end)
  FILTER (BOUND(?start) && (!BOUND(?end) || ?end >= ?start))
  BIND (IF(!BOUND(?end) && sameTerm(?lifecycle, cascade:MedicationActive), true, 1/0) AS ?ongoing)
}
